        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn IUABx, Traditional 16\"  Iron Art Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by artisans using the old world techniques of the hammer and anvil, the Traditional 16 Inch Iron Art Mortise Handleset is perfect for all types of homes including colonial, southwestern, and those with a more natural decor. The black iron finish grants it an antique feel. It is available in single cylinder and dummy functions. A mortise lock, it is for 1-3/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors with a 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/old-world-black-iron-lever-with-square-rose-acorn-iulbd\"><b>Old World Black Iron Lever With Square Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\" border=0\" class=\"text\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the 16\" Traditional Iron Art Mortise Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy gauge plated steel mortise case.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-friction brass latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>The deadbolt is made of brass with hardened steel inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" Standard, Optional up to 3\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C-Keyway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Blank trim for non-working doors that does not have a turnpiece or a cylinder. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a lever from both the exterior and the interior. Panic Proof: Turning of inside lever will retract both deadbolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the lever. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Due to the handmade craftsman nature of this product, all dimensions are approximate. DO NOT DRILL ANY HOLES until you have the actual pieces to be mounted.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
